OL,3,ASwiss glaciers suffer 'disastrous' year
OL,4,Aof ice loss, threatening water supplies
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwiss glaciers have suffered a
OL,7,Fnear-record loss of ice in 2026, new
OL,8,Fdata shows, as intense summer heatwaves
OL,9,Ftake their toll on Alpine peaks.
OL,11,FMore than 5% of the country's remaining
OL,12,Fglacier ice has disappeared in the last
OL,13,F12 months, which scientists say is
OL,14,F"extraordinary".
OL,16,FThey warn that such rapid melting is no
OL,17,Flonger a surprise given the pace of
OL,18,Fclimate change, but it could threaten
OL,19,Fwater supplies for farming, hydropower
OL,20,Fand transport in the decades ahead.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
