OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASwiss glaciers suffer 'disastrous' year
OL,4,Aof ice loss, threatening water supplies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe loss of glacier ice can also
OL,7,Fdestabilise mountain slopes and
OL,8,Fincrease the risk of landslides in some
OL,9,Fplaces - which can lead to flash
OL,10,Fflooding in extreme cases, as seen in
OL,11,FNepal in August.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
